## 📸 Application Screenshots

### 1. Gas Booking Case Type

The Gas Booking case type manages the complete cylinder booking process. The case lifecycle includes registration/login, gas booking, payment, payment approval, delivery updates, and customer feedback.

![Gas Booking Case Type](screenshots/gas-booking-case-type.png)

---

### 2. Connection Transfer Case Type

The Connection Transfer case type manages customer requests for transferring a gas connection. The workflow includes customer login, connection transfer details, distributor verification, manager verification, and final transfer processing.

![Connection Transfer Case Type](screenshots/connection-transfer-case-type.png)

---

### 3. Booking Complaints Case Type

The Booking Complaints case type handles complaints raised by customers regarding their gas booking. The lifecycle includes complaint registration, complaint review, manager approval, complaint solution, and customer notification.

![Booking Complaints Case Type](screenshots/booking-complaints-case-type.png)

---

### 4. Booking Complaint Workflow

The workflow manages the complaint-processing stages, including complaint selection, confirmation, review, approval, and handling of approved or rejected outcomes.

![Booking Complaint Workflow](screenshots/gas-booking-workflow.png)

---

### 5. Consumer Data Type

The Consumer Data Type stores information required for managing gas agency consumers, including consumer number, contact details, LPG ID, Aadhaar number, mobile number, state, and other consumer information.

![Consumer Data Type](screenshots/consumer-data-type.png)

---

### 6. Payment Data Type

The Payment Data Type stores payment-related information such as card holder name, card number, CVV code, expiry date, payment ID, payment type, and UPI ID.

![Payment Data Type](screenshots/payment-data-type.png)

---

### 7. Consumer Registration and Validations

The Consumer Registration Page collects the information required for customer registration. The form contains required fields and input validation before submission.

![Consumer Registration Page](screenshots/registration-page.png)
